flowchart TD
    NOTE["Discussion-02 behavior review<br/>Exact physical schemas, transport and claim mechanisms remain open"]
    START["Scheduled parent workflow"] --> DISC["Reusable source-schema discovery<br/>One full pass per selected table/cycle"]
    DISC --> A{"Table A eligible?"}
    DISC --> B{"Table B eligible?"}
    A -- Yes --> BA["Bronze A<br/>Stage, validate mapped schema, publish captured batch once"]
    B -- Yes --> BB["Bronze B<br/>Stage, validate mapped schema, publish captured batch once"]
    A -- No --> AB["Record blocked source table and reason<br/>Strict drift approved; failure mechanics still under review"]
    B -- No --> BBLOCK["Record blocked source table and reason<br/>Unrelated Bronze work continues"]
    BA --> S1A["Independent Silver 1 A<br/>Normalize, validate, deduplicate, commit"]
    BB --> S1B["Independent Silver 1 B<br/>Normalize, validate, deduplicate, commit"]
    S1A --> STATE["Record committed dataset version and source currency/window<br/>Keep task attempts separate from current readiness"]
    S1B --> STATE
    AB --> FAILED["Record latest expected upstream failure<br/>Older recent success does not bypass the default block"]
    BBLOCK --> FAILED
    STATE --> EVENT["Primary readiness event wakes blocked consumers"]
    FAILED --> EVENT
    STATE --> RECON["Periodic reconciliation fallback<br/>Repair lost or missed notifications"]
    EVENT --> RECHECK["Metadata plane rechecks ALL dependencies<br/>Event alone is not authorization"]
    RECON --> RECHECK
    RECHECK --> READY{"Committed, fresh, window-compatible required inputs<br/>and no blocking latest expected upstream failure?"}
    READY -- Yes --> CLAIM["Atomically claim eligible consumer work<br/>Idempotent effects; mechanism pending"]
    CLAIM --> S2["Silver 2 joined output<br/>Architecture only: not added to current Patient-only build"]
    READY -- No --> BLOCK["BLOCKED_BY_DEPENDENCY<br/>Persist reason and notify; not a failed transformation"]
    BLOCK --> WAIT["Wait for dependency recovery<br/>Healthy independent work continues"]
    WAIT -. Recovery notification .-> EVENT
    SLA["Separate availability SLA monitoring<br/>Record deadline breach and alert; not an execution veto"]
    BLOCK -. Deadline observations .-> SLA
    S2 -. Availability and time-to-recovery .-> SLA
    SLA -. Preserve original breach after recovery .-> HISTORY["Immutable SLA/recovery evidence"]
    NOTE -. Scope .-> DISC
    COORD["Smaller domain/workflow Airflow DAGs<br/>Metadata authoritatively evaluates readiness and initiates runs"]
    COORD -. Hybrid cross-DAG coordination .-> RECHECK
